flowchart TB
    User[Employee in web browser] --> Web[FastAPI BFF and Jinja workspace]
    Web <-->|OIDC code + PKCE| Keycloak[Keycloak IAM]
    Web <--> Redis[(Redis short-lived sessions)]
    Web --> Factory[Blueprint factory: enterprise + team + verified role]
    Factory --> Graph[LangGraph state machine]
    Graph <--> Ollama[Local Ollama tool-capable LLM]
    Graph --> Escalation[Read-only escalation Skill]
    Graph <-->|Checkpointed state| Pg[(PostgreSQL)]
    Graph --> MCPClient[Authenticated MCP client]
    Escalation --> MCPClient
    MCPClient --> MCP[Acme MCP server]
    MCP --> Policy[Verified user, role and customer scope]
    Policy --> Pg
    Web --> Human[Explicit human confirmation]
    Human --> MCPClient
    Graph --> Trace[Execution spans and tool events]
    MCP --> Audit[Business action receipts and audit events]
    Trace --> Pg
    Audit --> Pg
